  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {司法|しほう}を{司|つかさど}る (administer justice)\n- {財政|ざいせい}を{司|つかさど}る (oversee finances)\n- {運命|うんめい}を{司|つかさど}る (govern fate/destiny)\n- {記憶|きおく}を{司|つかさど}る (control memory — of a brain region)\n\nUSAGE:\nA somewhat literary and formal verb. In everyday conversation, {担当|たんとう}する (be in charge of) is more natural. {司|つかさど}る is preferred in formal writing, scientific descriptions (especially about brain functions and physiology), legal/governmental contexts, and literary or mythological contexts (e.g., a god who governs the seas).",
